  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 27 (Thursday, February 9, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. SHERRILL:\nH.R. 953.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nClause 18 of Section 8 of Article 1 of the Constitution of\nthe United States of America.\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo establish a network of federally-supported, locally-\nadministered child care options to improve economic, child\ndevelopment, and employment outcomes for children and their\nfamilies.\n[Page H829]\n</pre>",
